AddCollateralTest
├── given market is paused
│   └── it should revert
├── given market is frozen
│   └── it should revert
├── given assets is zero
│   └── it should revert
├── given onBehalf is zero address
│   └── it should revert
└── given assets is greater than zero
    ├── when user has insufficient balance
    │   └── it should revert
    └── when user has sufficient balance
        └── it should add collateral to position 